 straight line."], ["half", "la mitad", 300, 460, "Cut the circle in half."], ["measuring cup", "la taza medidora", 700, 450, "Fill the measuring cup to one cup."]]}, {"id": "colors", "n": 3, "title": "Colors", "es": "Los colores", "scene": "colors", "deck": "Twelve colors, and the sentence that uses each one.", "words": [["red", "rojo / roja", 110, 150, "The stop sign is red."], ["blue", "azul", 266, 150, "The sky is blue today."], ["yellow", "amarillo / amarilla", 422, 150, "The school bus is yellow."], ["green", "verde", 578, 150, "Go when the light is green."], ["orange", "anaranjado / naranja", 734, 150, "The basketball is orange."], ["purple", "morado / morada", 890, 150, "She has a purple backpack."], ["pink", "rosado / rosa", 110, 400, "The eraser is pink."], ["brown", "café / marrón", 266, 400, "My eyes are brown."], ["black", "negro / negra", 422, 400, "Write with a black pen."], ["white", "blanco / blanca", 578, 400, "The paper is white."], ["gray", "gris", 734, 400, "The sky is gray before the storm."], ["gold", "dorado / dorada", 890, 400, "The trophy is gold."]]}, {"id": "house", "n": 4, "title": "The house and yard", "es": "La casa y el patio", "scene": "house", "deck": "The outside of home: what the mail carrier, the neighbor and the landlord call things.", "words": [["house", "la casa", 420, 230, "Our house has two bedrooms."], ["roof", "el techo", 420, 140, "The roof leaks when it rains."], ["chimney", "la chimenea", 440, 90, "Smoke comes out of the chimney."], ["garage", "el garaje / la cochera", 700, 290, "The car is in the garage."], ["fence", "la cerca", 160, 340, "The dog jumped the fence."], ["mailbox", "el buzón", 860, 370, "Check the mailbox after school."], ["driveway", "la entrada para carros", 560, 430, "Park in the driveway, not on the street."], ["lawn mower", "la cortadora de césped", 260, 470, "My brother pushes the lawn mower."], ["porch", "el porche", 420, 330, "Grandma sits on the porch in the evening."], ["tree", "el árbol", 80, 